{{code|lang=mediawiki|copy=no|Some code}}

You can disable line numbers by setting the <code>line</code> parameter to 'no':

{{code|lang=mediawiki|line=no|<nowiki>{{code|lang=mediawiki|line=no|Some code}}</nowiki>}}

