Template:Infobox/Doc.text:
{{expand|scope=template documentation|reason=Provide more information about creating infoboxes.}}

This template is the basis to all [[:Category:Infobox|infoboxes]]. You shouldn't use it by itself, instead import it in a more specific infobox (e.g. {{tl|infobox application}}). You can either set the content directly or provide the content through a ''sub-template'' under <code>/Content</code>. I.e.:

{{code|lang=mediawiki|line=no|<nowiki>
{{infobox
  |title={{{title}}}
  |image={{{image}}}
  |content={{infobox example/content}}
}}
</nowiki>}}

Template:Issue/Doc.text:
This template inserts inline link to a specific repository issue. By default, it does so for the [https://www.github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs Nixpkgs] repository, but it can either point to any other NixOS repository, any GitHub repository in general, or even any other link.

{{issue|1}}

=== Usage ===

Simply specify the issue number in the template as the first argument to produce the issue listed above.

{{code|lang=mediawiki|line=no|<nowiki>{{issue|1}}</nowiki>}}

You can also specify an alternate text for the issue:

{{code|lang=mediawiki|line=no|<nowiki>{{issue|1|this issue}}</nowiki>}}

{{issue|1|this issue}}

You can also specify a whole alternate NixOS repository:

{{code|lang=mediawiki|line=no|<nowiki>{{issue|1|this nixos-artwork issue|nixos-artwork}}</nowiki>}}

{{issue|1|this nixos-artwork issue|nixos-artwork}}

Alternatively, you can specify any GitHub repository:

{{code|lang=mediawiki|line=no|<nowiki>{{issue|repo=nix-community/home-manager|1|this home-manager issue}}</nowiki>}}

{{issue|repo=nix-community/home-manager|1|this home-manager issue}}

Finally, you can bring your own link. However, try to use only repository issues with this template:

{{code|lang=mediawiki|line=no|<nowiki>{{issue|link=https://codeberg.org/librewolf/issues/issues/10||this Librewolf issue on Codeberg}}</nowiki>}}

{{issue|link=https://codeberg.org/librewolf/issues/issues/10||this Librewolf issue on Codeberg}}

